  "content_html": "<h1>keys</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">1 Jul 2019</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04656\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open keys\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04656-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04656-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04656-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04656-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"keys\" width=\"3024\" height=\"4032\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>keys</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nthey say that the loops go on forever\n \nin that sense we are caught\n \nis it possible to be open?\n \nlike a key hanging on a chain\n \nnext to the locked door\n \nbut the key has rusted beyond repair\n \ndo our keys also corrode\n \nwhen left alone\n \nin damp tunnels where our demons prowl in darkness\n \nreach in hold them\n \nthey will float to the surface\n \ncleanse in the sun\n</pre>\n",
